# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Build-context exclusions for `docker build` / `fly deploy`.
#
# This list is a security control, not an optimisation. The build context is the
# repository root, which holds odds/.env (real secret key and SMTP values),
# odds/db.sqlite3 (a local database) and three virtual environments. Anything
# not excluded here can be copied into an image layer.
#
# The image needs odds/ (source plus requirements.txt) and nothing else.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- VCS / editors ---------------------------------------------------------
.git
.gitignore
**/.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
.vs

# --- Secrets / local environment ------------------------------------------
.env
**/.env
.env.*
**/.env.*

# --- Local databases -------------------------------------------------------
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
**/db.sqlite3

# --- Virtual environments --------------------------------------------------
.venv/
**/.venv/
venv/
**/venv/
myvenv/
**/myvenv/
env/
**/env/

# --- Python bytecode / caches ---------------------------------------------
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# --- Django runtime artifacts ---------------------------------------------
*.log
**/*.log
staticfiles/
media/

# --- Deployment descriptors and documentation (not needed in the image) ----
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
fly.toml
docs/
README.md

# --- Scratch ---------------------------------------------------------------
tmp/
scratch/
*.zip
*.tar.gz
